in a sealed envelope in the United States mail,\nL75@P3: first class, postage prepaid, and addressed as follows. Listing the judge here constitutes a declaration that mailing to the\nL76@P3: judge will be completed no later than 24 hours after the document is filed.\nL77@P3: Service information continued on attached page\nL78@P3: 3. SERVED BY PERSONAL DELIVERY, OVERNIGHT MAIL, FACSIMILE TRANSMISSION OR EMAIL (state method\nL79@P3: for each person or entity served): Pursuant to F.R.Civ.P. 5 and/or controlling LBR, on (date) _______________, I served\nL80@P3: the following persons and/or entities by personal delivery, overnight mail service, or (for those who consented in writing to\nL81@P3: such service method), by facsimile transmission and/or email as follows. Listing the judge here constitutes a declaration\nL82@P3: that personal delivery on, or overnight mail to, the judge will be completed no later than 24 hours after the document is\nL83@P3: filed.\nL84@P3: Service information continued on attached page\nL85@P3: I declare under penalty of perjury under the laws of the United States that the foregoing is true and correct.\nL86@P3: Date Printed Name Signature\nL87@P3: This form is optional. It has been approved for use in the United States Bankruptcy Court for the Central District of California.\nL88@P3: December 2015 Page 4 F 3003-1.MOTION.BARDATE\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://www.cacb.uscourts.gov/sites/cacb/files/documents/forms/F3003-1.NOTICEBARDATE.pdf)\nciteturn1267view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; Content type: application/pdf; Number of pages: 3; Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn1246view17\",\"id\":3}); Total lines: 94\nL0@P0: Attorney or Party Name, Address, Telephone & FAX\nL1@P0: Nos., State Bar No. & Email Address\nL2@P0: FOR COURT USE ONLY\nL3@P0: Individual appearing without attorney\nL4@P0: Attorney for:\nL5@P0: UNITED STATES BANKRUPTCY COURT\nL6@P0: CENTRAL DISTRICT OF CALIFORNIA - DIVISION\nL7@P0: In re: CASE NO.:\nL8@P0: CHAPTER: 11\nL9@P0: NOTICE OF BAR DATE FOR FILING\nL10@P0: PROOFS OF CLAIM IN A CHAPTER 11 CASE\nL11@P0: [LBR 3003-1]\nL12@P0: No hearing: LBR 9013-1(q)\nL13@P0: Hearing information\nL14@P0: DATE:\nL15@P0: TIME:\nL16@P0: COURTROOM:\nL17@P0: ADDRESS:\nL18@P0: Debtor(s).\nL19@P0: 1. Bar Date. The court has set a deadline of (date) , 20 (Bar Date), for creditors in the\nL20@P0: above-referenced case to file proofs of claim against the Debtor’s estate. ON OR BEFORE THE BAR DATE,\nL21@P0: PROOFS OF CLAIM MUST BE FILED WITH THE COURT CLERK AT:\nL22@P0: 2. Form. You may obtain a Proof of Claim form (Official Form 410) on the Bankruptcy Court’s web site at\nL23@P0: http://www.cacb.uscourts.gov, or visit the Intake area at any division of the Court.\nL24@P0: 3. Exceptions to the Bar Date. Exceptions to the Bar Date include, but are not limited to, the following:\nL25@P0: (a) Executory contracts/unexpired leases. For claims arising from rejection of any executory contract or\nL26@P0: unexpired lease, the last day to file a Proof of Claim is the later of (a) the Bar Date or (b) 30 days after the\nL27@P0: date of entry of an order authorizing the rejection of such contract or lease or after any automatic rejection of\nL28@P0: such contract or lease. See 11 U.S.C. §§ 365(d)(4) and 502(g).\nL29@P0:  255 East Temple Street, Los Angeles, CA 90012 411 West Fourth Street, Santa Ana, CA 92701\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn1267view2 [wordlim: 200] Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn1246view18\",\"id\":3}); Total lines: 1\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAttorney or Party Name, Address, Telephone & Fax Numbers, and California State Bar Number (https://www.cacb.uscourts.gov/sites/cacb/files/documents/forms/F3007-1.1NOTICEOBJCLAIM.pdf)\nciteturn1267view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 6 days ago; Content type: applica